er the spacecraft is currently in use\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"maiden_flight\":{\"description\":\"Date of maiden flight\",\"format\":\"date\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the spacecraft\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":{\"properties\":{\"id\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"url\":{\"description\":\"API URL for this configuration\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"description\":\"Successful response\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Spacecraft configuration not found\"}},\"securitySource\":\"unspecified\"}"
